WEBVTT

00:00:29.233 --> 00:00:30.526
can be an insult,

00:00:30.568 --> 00:00:32.320
or going, "Get out of here.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.655
You're making a fool of yourself."

00:00:34.697 --> 00:00:36.866
Our body, we have signs.

00:00:36.908 --> 00:00:38.659
And we look at each other

00:00:38.659 --> 00:00:39.869
and the situation ...

00:00:39.869 --> 00:00:41.496
it might be a dire situation,

00:00:41.537 --> 00:00:43.206
and then we start laughing and go,

00:00:43.247 --> 00:00:46.167
"Somebody make a huge mistake.

00:00:46.209 --> 00:00:47.627
And you are in a ditch,

00:00:47.668 --> 00:00:49.670
You can't even get yourself out."

00:00:49.712 --> 00:00:52.173
And we laugh and we're happy
at the same time.

00:00:52.215 --> 00:00:54.217
That's why I say it's a state of mind.

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:58.638
FO: I have seen people watch you perform,
and they’re in the audience,

00:00:58.679 --> 00:01:01.641
they are mesmerized, they are smiling,